Shadows the upstream resource of the same name (the monochrome layer of both
adaptive launcher icons) by resource-overlay precedence, so no Chromium
glyph ships in the product (decision 0019; patch specification 0002 records
the mechanism). The launcher reads this layer as a mask and recolours it, so
the referenced bitmap carries the mark in its alpha channel only
(generate_icons.py, monochrome_alpha).
-->
<bitmap xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:src="@mipmap/taffygo_themed_glyph"
    android:gravity="center" />
